<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-page="visual-themes">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="100 款视觉主题与艺术配色图鉴">
    <title>CHROMA 100 · 色谱档案馆</title>
    <script src="/js/theme.js?v=3"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css?v=3">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/visual_themes.css?v=1">
</head>
<body class="visual-themes-body">
    <a class="atlas-skip-link" href="#theme-gallery">跳到主题图鉴</a>

    <header class="atlas-header">
        <nav class="atlas-nav" aria-label="页面导航">
            <a href="/tools" class="atlas-back"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> 返回工具</a>
            <span class="atlas-edition">GUCCANG / VISUAL ARCHIVE / 2026</span>
            <a href="/main" class="atlas-home">首页</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="atlas-hero">
            <div class="atlas-title-block">
                <p class="atlas-kicker">A curated atlas of color &amp; form</p>
                <h1><span>CHROMA</span><strong>100</strong></h1>
                <p class="atlas-cn-title">色谱档案馆</p>
            </div>
            <div class="atlas-intro">
                <p>一百种视觉气候，一百套可被记住的颜色关系。</p>
                <p>从东方器物到电影光色，每张卡片都是一幅微型艺术标本。仅供观赏、比较与采色。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="atlas-mark" aria-hidden="true">
                <span>色</span><i></i><span>形</span><i></i><span>光</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="atlas-main">
        <section class="atlas-controls" aria-label="图鉴筛选">
            <div class="atlas-search-wrap">
                <label for="theme-search">查找风格</label>
                <div class="atlas-search-field">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
                    <input id="theme-search" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="名称、系列或关键词">
                    <kbd>/</kbd>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="atlas-filter-wrap">
                <span class="atlas-filter-label">系列</span>
                <div class="atlas-filters" id="theme-filters" role="group" aria-label="按系列筛选"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="atlas-index-line">
            <p><span id="visible-count">100</span> / 100 COLLECTIONS</p>
            <p id="active-series">全部馆藏</p>
        </div>

        <section class="atlas-gallery" id="theme-gallery" aria-label="视觉主题图鉴"></section>
        <p class="atlas-empty" id="theme-empty" hidden>没有找到相符的视觉主题，换一个关键词试试。</p>
    </main>

    <footer class="atlas-footer">
        <p>CHROMA 100</p>
        <p>颜色不是装饰，而是情绪发生的方式。</p>
        <a href="#top" onclick="window.scrollTo({top: 0, behavior: 'smooth'}); return false;">回到顶部 ↑</a>
    </footer>

    <dialog class="atlas-dialog" id="theme-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-theme-name">
        <div class="dialog-shell">
            <button class="dialog-close" id="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭详情">×</button>
            <div class="dialog-art" id="dialog-art" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="dialog-copy">
                <p class="dialog-number" id="dialog-theme-number"></p>
                <h2 id="dialog-theme-name"></h2>
                <p class="dialog-en" id="dialog-theme-en"></p>
                <p class="dialog-description" id="dialog-theme-description"></p>
                <div class="dialog-palette" id="dialog-palette" aria-label="主题色值"></div>
                <p class="dialog-tip">点击任意色值即可复制</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </dialog>

    <div class="atlas-toast" id="atlas-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <noscript><p class="atlas-noscript">需要启用 JavaScript 才能浏览这份图鉴。</p></noscript>
    <script src="/js/visual_themes.js?v=1" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
